    "detailed_description": "<h1>From Mirage Game Studios</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To Our Space Realtors,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's with genuine disappointment that we have to tell you development on Space for Sale has ended.\u00a0Simply put, the game didn't perform as we needed it to commercially, and continuing development wasn't sustainable. This was a tough call, and we understand it's frustrating news for those who were looking forward to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We poured a lot of effort into Space for Sale, believing in its potential. However, sometimes things just don't work out as planned, and we have to face those realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We truly appreciate the support of our Factoneers and Space Realtors \u2013 everyone who engaged with the game and our studio. Seeing your enthusiasm and creativity meant a great deal to us. We hope that even though our journey together on this project has ended, the spirit of our games will continue to resonate within the wider gaming community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for being a part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sincerely,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mirage Game Studios</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/a517bda4cc529af0cf741467b1ba2b41.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/a517bda4cc529af0cf741467b1ba2b41.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Space for Sale</strong> is an interplanetary, top-down Space Realty management game with a focus on problem-solving and exploration. Played either solo or with a friend, it's up to you to transform wild, uninhabited lands into bustling communities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've just launched your very own Space Realty franchise, complete with a brand-new, refurbished spaceship HQ and a solar system full of opportunities at your fingertips! Build your reputation by satisfying the needs of various alien clients with the services you offer. In return, they'll provide you with the resources to expand your business across the planet. As word of your endeavors spreads throughout the galaxy, more demanding clients may approach you with special\u2014and potentially dangerous\u2014requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In space, danger comes in many forms. Some of the local flora and fauna have developed a taste for Space Realtors, and you\u2019ll need to adapt to these challenging conditions to succeed. Study how local lifeforms have survived each planet's unique environment, and use your discoveries to enhance the structures and gadgets you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Improvise, adapt, profit!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research wildlife to upgrade your gadgets and base. Learn to survive in the harshest biomes, and create the most sought-after real estate in your solar system!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The planets in Space for Sale aren't just ripe with real estate opportunities\u2014they're also filled with intriguing events to take part in and mysteries to uncover! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gadgets Galore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A space realtor is only as good as their tools. To thrive in these initially inhospitable environments, you'll need to discover and construct an array of useful gadgets and devices. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share the journey with a friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double your chances of success in two-player co-op. Share crafting materials, build your base, and team up to achieve maximum client satisfaction!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/a517bda4cc529af0cf741467b1ba2b41.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/a517bda4cc529af0cf741467b1ba2b41.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Space for Sale</strong> is an interplanetary, top-down Space Realty management game with a focus on problem-solving and exploration. Played either solo or with a friend, it's up to you to transform wild, uninhabited lands into bustling communities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've just launched your very own Space Realty franchise, complete with a brand-new, refurbished spaceship HQ and a solar system full of opportunities at your fingertips! Build your reputation by satisfying the needs of various alien clients with the services you offer. In return, they'll provide you with the resources to expand your business across the planet. As word of your endeavors spreads throughout the galaxy, more demanding clients may approach you with special\u2014and potentially dangerous\u2014requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In space, danger comes in many forms. Some of the local flora and fauna have developed a taste for Space Realtors, and you\u2019ll need to adapt to these challenging conditions to succeed. Study how local lifeforms have survived each planet's unique environment, and use your discoveries to enhance the structures and gadgets you create!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Improvise, adapt, profit!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/b359d69cc61d084a76c9c9d98e767ffa.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research wildlife to upgrade your gadgets and base. Learn to survive in the harshest biomes, and create the most sought-after real estate in your solar system!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rich Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/7de9a50ca7acddd0e544fa6e18672157.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The planets in Space for Sale aren't just ripe with real estate opportunities\u2014they're also filled with intriguing events to take part in and mysteries to uncover! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gadgets Galore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/729e735e7312845c389b7b3dbe37b4d7.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A space realtor is only as good as their tools. To thrive in these initially inhospitable environments, you'll need to discover and construct an array of useful gadgets and devices. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share the journey with a friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.poster.avif?t=1744709274\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.webm?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1624060/extras/3a0188760e7d96ec27ced806755db8db.mp4?t=1744709274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Double your chances of success in two-player co-op. Share crafting materials, build your base, and team up to achieve maximum client satisfaction!</p>",
